      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 271199,
      "end_ms": 273769,
      "text": "啊而是你不停的在寻找"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 273769,
      "end_ms": 275479,
      "text": "而是孤魂野鬼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 275479,
      "end_ms": 277220,
      "text": "你是个孤魂野鬼啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 279100,
      "end_ms": 282300,
      "text": "行孤魂野鬼好于行尸走肉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 282300,
      "end_ms": 283290,
      "text": "为什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 283290,
      "end_ms": 285360,
      "text": "因为你一直在找投胎啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 285360,
      "end_ms": 287700,
      "text": "找宁采臣要去P的哈哈"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 287880,
      "end_ms": 289470,
      "text": "那就吸它啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 289470,
      "end_ms": 291280,
      "text": "好优于他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 291900,
      "end_ms": 293300,
      "text": "这个就是比喻啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 293300,
      "end_ms": 295160,
      "text": "就是说有点像孤魂野鬼一样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 295160,
      "end_ms": 297710,
      "text": "但是你你就是不停的在找那个缝隙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 297710,
      "end_ms": 300670,
      "text": "但是你找到你找来找去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 300670,
      "end_ms": 302530,
      "text": "一定要一定要下去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 302530,
      "end_ms": 305580,
      "text": "一定要下去啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 305580,
      "end_ms": 307890,
      "text": "啊不是行尸走肉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 307890,
      "end_ms": 309840,
      "text": "而是孤魂野鬼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 309840,
      "end_ms": 311080,
      "text": "然后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 312860,
      "end_ms": 317270,
      "text": "你这个市面上飘着的寻找时机的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 317270,
      "end_ms": 318980,
      "text": "你是在寻找时机的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 318980,
      "end_ms": 320180,
      "text": "你并不是麻木的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 320180,
      "end_ms": 321440,
      "text": "就是不麻木啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 321440,
      "end_ms": 322240,
      "text": "不麻木"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 322240,
      "end_ms": 324070,
      "text": "你是在寻找时机"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 324070,
      "end_ms": 328390,
      "text": "寻找恰当的这个态势和环境"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 328390,
      "end_ms": 329650,
      "text": "寻找时机"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 329650,
      "end_ms": 332480,
      "text": "环境和一个力量对比的一个态势"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 333720,
      "end_ms": 334970,
      "text": "不停的在找"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 334970,
      "end_ms": 336470,
      "text": "不停的在找"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 336470,
      "end_ms": 339230,
      "text": "有这种伺机而动的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 339230,
      "end_ms": 343160,
      "text": "有伺机而动的这种偏执"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 343620,
      "end_ms": 346620,
      "text": "你具有一种伺机而动的偏执狂啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 346620,
      "end_ms": 347560,
      "text": "偏执症"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 348360,
      "end_ms": 349550,
      "text": "这是个优点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 349550,
      "end_ms": 350240,
      "text": "就是优点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 350240,
      "end_ms": 353720,
      "text": "这是你的刺头次性的一个不是杠精"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 353720,
      "end_ms": 355160,
      "text": "不会处处都抬杠的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 355160,
      "end_ms": 357340,
      "text": "因为你们要意识到啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 357620,
      "end_ms": 360320,
      "text": "这里就是说不同于杠精"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 360320,
      "end_ms": 366500,
      "text": "不同于杠精的地方就在于找那个刺头钻到底诶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 366500,
      "end_ms": 368300,
      "text": "就是伺机而动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 368300,
      "end_ms": 369080,
      "text": "偏执症"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 369080,
      "end_ms": 371060,
      "text": "虽然我平时在天上飘着"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 371060,
      "end_ms": 372200,
      "text": "但是我一旦钻下去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 372200,
      "end_ms": 373220,
      "text": "我要钻到底"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 373220,
      "end_ms": 376980,
      "text": "尽全力尽全力找到一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 377099,
      "end_ms": 378419,
      "text": "找到一个点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 378419,
      "end_ms": 380960,
      "text": "就要尽全力钻到底"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 382819,
      "end_ms": 387160,
      "text": "嗯钻头机自宫螺丝啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 388759,
      "end_ms": 389919,
      "text": "他不是杠精"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 389919,
      "end_ms": 391779,
      "text": "杠精是现代犬儒主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 391779,
      "end_ms": 393369,
      "text": "他们是什么都要杠的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 393369,
      "end_ms": 396340,
      "text": "他们是屈服的无力的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 396340,
      "end_ms": 397810,
      "text": "他就是杠精"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 397810,
      "end_ms": 399850,
      "text": "那就是什么小图钉而已"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 399850,
      "end_ms": 400870,
      "text": "这里打一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 400870,
      "end_ms": 401350,
      "text": "那里打一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 401350,
      "end_ms": 402240,
      "text": "那里打一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 402240,
      "end_ms": 404580,
      "text": "杠精就是到处都留下一个细小"
    },
    {
